        },
        {
          "text": "Hashize imyaka ibiri yiramvuriye, Abusalomu arārika abamukemurira intama i Bayali‐hasori, hāri hahereranye n’i Bgefurayimu; maz’ atumira abana b’umwami bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aragenda abarira umwami, ati Jewe umusavyi wawe ndafise abankemurira intama; none ndakwinginze mugenzi, mwe n’abantu bawe muze tujane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami yishura Abusalomu, at’ Oyaye mwananje, ntitwojana twese, ngo tuje kukurusha. Abusalomu aramugōbēra, ariko yanka kugenda, mugabo aramuhezagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Abusalomu aramubarira, ati None rero k’utaje, urungike mukurwanje Amunoni, aze tujane. Umwami aramubaza, at’ Ugombera iki ko mujana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Abusalomu aramuzigitīra, umwami araruha aremera ko Amunoni n’ abandi bana biwe bose bajana na we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
